# Prettier always writes LF, but core.autocrlf=true checks files out as CRLF.
# Left alone, every `npm run format` rewrites every file back to LF and the
# whole repo shows as modified. Pin LF in the working tree so formatting is
# stable on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Vendored Claude Design snapshots are byte-for-byte copies of upstream, which
# emits LF. Covered by the rule above, but kept explicit because a clean re-pull
# diff depends on it. See docs/agents/design.md.
design/**/*.dc.html text eol=lf

# Binary assets — never line-ending converted, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
